        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Looking at the way telescope.nvim handles lsp calls, they seem to add the location using the following:\r\n```lua\r\nvim.cmd \"normal! m'\"\r\n```\r\nSpecifically for pickers from LSP type sources. Perhaps this would be useful.",
